From: enij90 <226572015+enij90@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] fix(evdev): keep the Legion G9's Legion button held through chords

The Lenovo Legion G9 controller (GameSir, 3537:1134) hides its Legion button
(BTN_MODE) while another button is held with it, and reports it again about
150 ms after that button is released if Legion is still held. A target such
as the Steam Deck sees a lone Guide press followed by the other button:
Steam opens its menu on release and never sees the chord.

Keep Legion held through those gaps for this controller, and release it
only once it has stayed up for 200 ms (cancelled if it comes back). A lone
Legion press is delayed by that much on release; a long press still powers
the controller off.

